      "status": "mathematical proof reconstructed",
      "correspondence": "AmbCyc applies the same B_F after identifying the relative automorphism indexed by γ⁻¹. The two branches of FW.cyc call memZ and ambCyc independently and apply core with stickH, then substitute the ambiguous bound in the Nth power. The branch outputs are ℓ(B_F^N)^2 at odd primes and ((2^{φ(4f)})^N B_F^N)^2 at two. The original abelian-tower bound uses embedding and field comparison.",
      "review": "Matched both branch constants, exponent conditions and the inverse generator to their proof lines. Recomputed the Minkowski bound, residue degree of two, relative generator order and base-field Kummer count. Independently verified by a second reader."
