  "outstanding": [
    "SNV derives twisted mod-ℓ nonvanishing at fixed projection depth, and STP passes to the uniform integral ideal membership. DSG derives the dyadic signature bound. The integral class-group annihilator and odd-prime reflection have separate suppliers. The class coinvariant argument and its application to both branches are reconstructed here."
